{"id":"n17596-4-7","stage":0,"title":"물 · 水","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17596-4-7-1","ko":"이 배 정말 맛있다.","zh":"这梨真好吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"배","meaning":"梨","explanation":"배：梨。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31454","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있다.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"梨","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"31454","definition":"秋季收获的圆圆的果实。皮黄、果肉为白色，汁多且发甜。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7651a90648433e87530d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17596-4-7-2","ko":"그렇지? 물도 많고 진짜 달아.","zh":"是吧？水分多，又很甜。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇지?","meaning":"是呀，就是","explanation":"그렇지：是呀，就是。","readings":[{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26031","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}},{"text":"물도","meaning":"水，汁","explanation":"물：水，汁；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"4","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물도","audio":"/audio/6e90c71cb86da56af64a.mp3"}},{"text":"많고","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많고","audio":"/audio/85297c4d772ee0675cf5.mp3"}},{"text":"진짜","meaning":"真，真的","explanation":"진짜：真，真的。","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71538","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}},{"text":"달아.","meaning":"甜，甘甜","explanation":"달다：甜，甘甜；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62741","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달아","audio":"/audio/087eaf52e981239a8c16.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"66da57bd505cc1e1","term":"그렇지","zh":"是呀，就是","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3","entryId":"26031","definition":"某个事实与自己所想的一致时，以感叹的语气所说的话。